{
	"title": "a process run here is its own owner: its offer at its own node (work/lisp/runners/lisp, its children { runners }), offers() by its id, run on like the session's; a process run on it names it as its runner (ermine.process.runner: the offer's id and path). stopping the offering process stops what runs on its offers first, newest first, \"runner-stopped\", then its own handle with the reason given; its offer's node and folder go with it, out of offers(); a stopped process offers nothing: nothing-there. withdrawn while the offering process runs: what runs on it stopped \"withdrawn\", the offering process still running, its folder kept (empty), its runner gone: not-a-runner. the offering process's own scope torn down alone (from above, by a host): the rest go too, what runs on its offer \"runner-stopped\", its handle's stop given no reason, its row and offer gone",
